      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Home Builders constructed 41 bungalow‑style homes in Willo during the 1920s, sparking the neighborhood’s early residential boom.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://willophx.com/about/history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The 1930s FHA standards introduced French Provincial and Monterey styles to Willo, shaping its ranch‑style houses today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
